{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785225828222", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "我已经获得了有力的研究锚点。关键先行工作已确认：\n\n1. **Lahnala et al. (2021)** — “A Historical Analysis of Harmonic Progressions Using Chord Embeddings” (SMC 2021) — 直接的先行工作：和弦嵌入 + 历史分析\n2. **Herremans & Chuan (2017)** — “Modeling Musical Context with Word2vec” — 用于音乐的和弦/语境 word2vec\n3. **Weiss et al. (2019)** — 西方古典音乐风格演变的计算分析\n4. **DeGroot (1974), Friedkin-Johnsen (1990)** — 经典的观点动力学模型，现被应用于音乐\n5. **DCML 语料库** — “A corpus and a modular infrastructure for the empirical study of (an)notated music” (OpenAlex W4409781970)\n\n现在让我更新待办事项并输出最终评审。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "6abdad2f-73bf-40e0-8193-528eab49ee13", "uuid": "00c7e28f-e39a-4d12-acda-66be7be3812a"}
